{"id":"P035-2","subject":"P","unit":"P035","unitTitle":"2024 상반기 · 24.05.18 부산교통공사 (전기직) (사람인)","set":2,"questions":[{"id":"P035-S2-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (전기직) (사람인) · 객관식 26번","searchText":" 26\n\n동기 발전기의 고조파를 감소시키기 위한 대책 방안으로\n\n옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 공극의 간격을 줄인다.\n\n② 단절권 및 분포권을 사용한다.\n\n③ 전기자 슬롯을 스큐 슬롯으로 한다.\n\n④ 전기자 반작용을 작게한다.","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (전기직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e14-m26","number":26},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e14-m26-q.webp","width":678,"height":483},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e14-m26-e1.webp","width":678,"height":899}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P035-S2-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (전기직) (사람인) · 객관식 27번","searchText":" 27\n\n2차측에 100V의 단자를 갖는 단상변압기가 있다.\n\n이 단자에 1Ω의 저항을 접속하였을 때, 1차측의 전압이\n\n1600V였고 4A 의 전류가 흘렀다. 이 경우, 2차측에\n\n흐르는 전류는 몇 A 인가?\n\n\n① 40          ② 60\n\n③ 80          ④ 100","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (전기직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e14-m27","number":27},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e14-m27-q.webp","width":678,"height":484},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e14-m27-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1359}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P035-S2-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (전기직) (사람인) · 객관식 28번","searchText":" 28\n\n단상 유도전동기의 기동방법에서 기동토크가 큰 순서로옳\n\n은 것은?\n\n\n① 반발기동형> 분상기동형> 콘덴서기동형> 셰이딩코일형\n\n② 반발기동형> 콘덴서기동형> 분상기동형> 셰이딩코일형\n\n③ 콘덴서기동형> 셰이딩코일형> 반발유도형> 분상기동형\n\n④ 분상기동형> 반발유도형> 셰이딩코일형> 콘덴서기동형","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (전기직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e14-m28","number":28},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e14-m28-q.webp","width":678,"height":394},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e14-m28-e1.webp","width":696,"height":523}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P035-S2-Q04","number":4,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (전기직) (사람인) · 객관식 29번","searchText":" 29\n\n그림과 같이 평형부하가 대칭 3상 전원에 접속되어 있을\n\n때, 부하의 상전압은 23kV이다. 만약 선의 X점에서 단\n선이 발생한다면, 단선부분의 양단 전압은 역 몇 kV인가?\n\n(단, 전원의 전압은 변화하지 않는다.)\n\n\n\n\n\n① 약 23        ② 약 33\n\n③ 약 35        ④ 약 40","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (전기직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e14-m29","number":29},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e14-m29-q.webp","width":696,"height":1007},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e14-m29-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e14-m29-e2.webp","width":696,"height":1883}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P035-S2-Q05","number":5,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (전기직) (사람인) · 객관식 30번","searchText":" 30\n\n다음과 같은 회로에서             A일 때,                 cos\n2차측 단자에 나타나는 유기 기전력 는 몇 V인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n①               ②               cos      cos\n③              ④              sin       sin","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (전기직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e14-m30","number":30},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e14-m30-q.webp","width":696,"height":875},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e14-m30-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1545}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P035-S2-Q06","number":6,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (전기직) (사람인) · 객관식 31번","searchText":" 31\n\n의 변환은?\n\n\n       \n①\n       \n②\n      \n③\n\n              \n④ ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (전기직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e14-m31","number":31},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e14-m31-q.webp","width":678,"height":685},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e14-m31-e1.webp","width":678,"height":337},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e14-m31-e2.webp","width":696,"height":1027}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P035-S2-Q07","number":7,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (전기직) (사람인) · 객관식 32번","searchText":" 32\n\n입력신호 와 출력신호 의 관계가\n                        일 때, \n\n전달함수는?\n\n\n                             \n①            ②    \n\n                                \n③            ④ ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (전기직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e14-m32","number":32},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e14-m32-q.webp","width":678,"height":621},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e14-m32-e1.webp","width":696,"height":857}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P035-S2-Q08","number":8,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (전기직) (사람인) · 객관식 33번","searchText":" 33\n\n                           \n개루프 전달함수가              일 때,       \n단위계단입력에 대한 정상상태오차가 였다.\n\n이 때, 는 얼마인가?\n\n\n① 200         ② 220\n\n③ 240         ④ 260","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (전기직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e14-m33","number":33},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e14-m33-q.webp","width":678,"height":577},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e14-m33-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1065}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P035-S2-Q09","number":9,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (전기직) (사람인) · 객관식 34번","searchText":" 34\n\n             \n함수             의 역라플라스 변환은? \n\n\n① \n② \n③ sin\n④ ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (전기직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e14-m34","number":34},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e14-m34-q.webp","width":696,"height":655},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e14-m34-e1.webp","width":678,"height":817},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e14-m34-e2.webp","width":696,"height":1883}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P035-S2-Q10","number":10,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (전기직) (사람인) · 객관식 35번","searchText":" 35\n\n다음과 같은 블록선도에서 일 때, 는 얼마인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 192.7             ② 207.2\n\n③ 222.2             ④ 237.2","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (전기직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e14-m35","number":35},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e14-m35-q.webp","width":696,"height":601},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e14-m35-e1.webp","width":678,"height":922}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P035-S2-Q11","number":11,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (전기직) (사람인) · 객관식 36번","searchText":" 36\n\n\n교류 전원의 전압이               cosV,\n\n전류가                    주어질 때,     sinA으로\n\n유효전력과 무효전력은 각각 어떻게 작용하는가?\n\n① 유효전력 kW 공급, 무효전력 kVar공급\n② 유효전력 kW 공급, 무효전력 kVar흡수\n③ 유효전력 kW 공급, 무효전력 kVar공급\n④ 유효전력 kW 공급, 무효전력 kVar흡수","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (전기직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e14-m36","number":36},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e14-m36-q.webp","width":696,"height":627},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e14-m36-e1.webp","width":678,"height":959},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e14-m36-e2.webp","width":696,"height":865}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P035-S2-Q12","number":12,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (전기직) (사람인) · 객관식 37번","searchText":" 37\n\n평형 3상 회로에서 그림과 같이 변류기를 접속하고 전류계\n를 연결하였을 때, 과 에 흐르는 전류가 50A 였다\n면, 에 흐르는 전류는 약 몇 A인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 57.7         ② 70.7\n\n③ 86.6             ④ 94.6","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (전기직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e14-m37","number":37},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e14-m37-q.webp","width":678,"height":810},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e14-m37-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1019}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P035-S2-Q13","number":13,"question":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (전기직) (사람인) · 객관식 38번","searchText":" 38\n\n그림과 같이 7Ω의 저항을 무한이 연결할 때, 와 \n\n단자 우측부분의 합성저항은 약 몇 Ω인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 12.4         ② 16.9\n\n③ 19.1         ④ 21.6","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.05.18 부산교통공사 (전기직) (사람인)","originalId":"2024h1-e14-m38","number":38},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e14-m38-q.webp","width":678,"height":670},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electri